# (LADDER-HEAD i2, w2/gen_shield5.py) T5: the heater a size up with an ARCHED top (T4 flat, T6 flared points), a gilt
# chevron (device) under the jewelled boss (G: the gem at T5) and no cross (T6's)
# (LADDER-HEAD alloys i3, i3/src/t5shield.py) T5: the face in the BODY alloy (the panel: "the gold shield never changes
# on any alloy"): a polished field lit top-left with a specular, a dark lower core, a 1 px chevron in the trim metal under
# the gem boss, the trim rim; no P on the face (the filigree's gilt plane no longer floods it)
